"playtime_forever": 23040, "playtime_last_two_weeks": 771, "playtime_at_review": 20387, "last_played": 1787921659, "avatar": "facdbde350c6ef2c559b2fa91420267b95eb8d65"}, "language": "schinese", "review": "🎖️ 战地简报：为了超级地球！\n🎖️ Battlefield Briefing: For Super Earth!\n🌍 自由之味 | The Taste of Freedom\n《绝地潜兵2》不仅仅是一款游戏，它是每一位公民履行义务的神圣殿堂。在这里，你不需要思考为什么要战斗，你只需要知道，当你的靴子踏上异星土地的那一刻，你就是自由的化身。\nHelldivers 2 is not just a game; it is a sacred temple where every citizen fulfills their duty. Here, you don’t need to ask why you fight. You only need to know that the moment your boots hit alien soil, you are the living embodiment of Liberty.\n\n🔥 毁灭的艺术 | The Art of Destruction\n没有什么比呼叫一次“轨道精准打击”更让人心旷神怡了。无论是那些多腿的虫子，还是那些毫无灵魂的铁罐头，在500KG炸弹的圣光下，它们都将化为正义的尘埃。这种爆炸的美学，是超级地球送给银河系最好的礼物。\nNothing warms the heart more than calling in an \"Orbital Precision Strike.\" Whether it's those multi-legged bugs or soulless scrap metals, they all turn into the dust of justice under the holy light of a 500KG Bomb. This aesthetic of explosion is the finest gift Super Earth offers to the galaxy.\n\n🤝 友军伤害？那是英雄的代价 | Friendly Fire? A Hero's Price\n在传播民主的道路上，总会有一些小小的“意外”。如果你的队友不小心被你的炮塔扫射成了筛子，请不要悲伤。记住：每一位牺牲的潜兵都是通往胜利的垫脚石。\nOn the path to spreading democracy, small \"accidents\" are bound to happen. If a teammate is accidentally shredded by your sentry turret, do not grieve. Remember: Every fallen Helldiver is a stepping stone to victory.\n\n“自由永不眠，只要我们还在扣动扳机。”\n\"Liberty never sleeps, as long as we keep pulling the trigger.\"\n\n总结： 每一秒的犹豫都是对超级地球的背叛。现在就穿上你的披风，加入这场伟大的圣战！\nSummary: Every second of hesitation is a betrayal of Super Earth. Don your cape now and join this glorious crusade!", "timestamp_created": 1771178558, "timestamp_updated": 1771178558, "voted_up": true, "votes_up": 0, "votes_funny": 0, "weighted_vote_score": 0.5, "comment_count": 0, "steam_purchase": true, "received_for_free": false, "refunded": false, "written_during_early_access": false, "primarily_steam_deck": false, "app_release_date": "1707382200", 